{"id":"sensation","lemma":"sensation","pos":"noun","rank":2512,"glosses":["sensation"],"ipa":"/sɑ̃.sa.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/Fr-la_sensation.ogg/Fr-la_sensation.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sensations"},"formAudio":{"sensations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-sensations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je connais cette sensation.","en":"I know the feeling.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"C'était une sensation bizarre.","en":"It was a weird feeling.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"bizarre"}]},{"text":"C'est une sensation vraiment bonne.","en":"It feels really good.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"truly"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"}]},{"text":"J'ai eu exactement la même sensation.","en":"I had the exact same feeling.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"exactly, quite"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"same"},null]},{"text":"Ce fut une sensation merveilleuse.","en":"It was a wonderful feeling.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"marvelous, brilliant","l":"merveilleux"}]}]}